    "summary": "runSubsystemPass now summarises each subsystem with no summary after the grouping. It makes one completeStructured call through buildSummariserProvider (tiers.cheap, injectable), with a yield between calls and never two at once. The prompt is src/prompts/analyze/subsystem-summariser.system.md, shipped by copy-assets and registered with the boot validator through src/analyze/summariser/subsystem-prompt.ts. Its input is the subsystem's name, its files with their exported names, and its connections by name. A failed call is logged and counted, and the summary stays null. The generation is re-read before each call and before each write, and the loop stops if it advanced. writeSubsystemSummary sets a summary only on the row grouped at that generation.",
